# Task 21 — audit write inside a narrowed CAP (density v4).
# The scoped body's closure is {writeFx, nowFx} (the path derivation
# reads the clock inside the scope). Probes
# CapabilityScopeUnsatisfiable on the natural [writeFx]-only grant.
@v=1 root=app
writeT FNT [stringT] intT [writeFx]
write FN "strand-builtin:Filesystem.Write" writeT [writeFx]
ts APP intToStr [(APP now [])]
logPath APP concat [(STR "audit-") ts]
writeCall APP write [logPath]
scoped CAP [writeFx nowFx] writeCall
app APP add [scoped 7]
